# Every room_volume the real chorus-server sent the kitchen's player while
# crates/server/tests/limits_hold_for_every_volume_path.rs drove every volume path, one
# frame (type 0x38, 6-byte payload: gain, limit, ramp_ms) per line. Read by that test and
# by firmware/tests/test_volume.c, which feeds it through the C endpoint's volume path.
# the greeting
38 00 06 01 f4 03 20 00 00
# volume above the limit
38 00 06 03 20 03 20 00 00
# volume_step
38 00 06 02 bc 03 20 00 00
# group_volume
38 00 06 03 20 03 20 00 00
# group_volume_step
38 00 06 02 38 03 20 00 00
# limit below the volume
38 00 06 01 2c 01 2c 00 00
# mute
38 00 06 00 00 01 2c 00 00
# unmute
38 00 06 01 2c 01 2c 00 00
# quiet hours, active at the civil time
38 00 06 00 c8 00 c8 00 00
# controller_command volume_step -5 points
38 00 06 00 96 00 c8 00 00
